l  spin up a cluster in less than 90  seconds let's talk about relational  databases or our dbmss SQL as the  language still has unsurpassed qualities  and our DBMS is such as MySQL and  PostgreSQL are very popular this is why  Google Cloud SQL is a managed service  that supports both of these relational  databases this is a great solution for  storing your existing or new application  there simply choose between MySQL and  PostgreSQL select a machine size with up  to hundreds of gigabytes of RAM and  terabytes of storage select a zone and  cloud SQL will take care of providing  the following encryption at rest and in  transit a private IP address data  replication between multiple zones with  automatic failover automated backups as  well as point in time recovery staying  with relational databases google also  offers cloud spanner a horizontally  scalable strongly consistent relational  database as a service make sure to check  out is truly innovative technology that  defies the cap theorem and that many  Google services are built on in the no  SQL department cloud files store is a  highly scalable strongly consistent  database offering two modes the native  mode offering real-time updates and  offline support for mobile developers  and the data store mode for back-end  developers looking for a schema list  documents database cloud BigTable will  complement your storage options with a  petabyte scale fully managed no SQL  database service this will be mostly  suited for large analytical and  operation workloads as it comes with  high throughput characteristics such as  consistent sub 10 millisecond latency in  any case you should visit cloud at  google.com slash storage options for a  decision tree to understand which is the  best database for you GCP has numerous  other data related products some  particularly innovative be sure to  consider the following pop sub for  producing and consuming messages  globally across all GTP zones and  regions file store for appli